<title>INDIA: India's Tata Power up on approval report.</title>
<headline>India's Tata Power up on approval report.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Tata Power rose 8.50 rupees, or six percent, to 147 rupees in late trade on the Bombay bourse on Tuesday, traders said.</p>
<p>They said the shares had gained on the back of a newspaper report that the state government had approved a proposal by Tata Electric Companies to set up a 450 MW power plant in the western Maharashtra state.</p>
</text>
